```
\endgroup
::::
:::

* Deep Learning (2011-Present)
::: columns
:::: {.column width=55%}
- @Deep learning@
  - Use ML models with multiple layers of computing elements
  - Ideas known since 1970s, but then forgot
  - Success in handwritten digit recognition in 1990s

::::
:::: {.column width=40%}

